    {
      "id": "075b122ae30066b231b17d4642093346fe33f421c0e0d7bbf9ea816e16991a83",
      "text": "Patterns of Work",
      "hash": "451912cbee5f0ec6ab7874916ee61c5d7d98c7c960493b524130e6c14b3e3f92"
    },
    {
      "id": "b22c92965eb04ce7a109796f737eb91bbcc4f947e0030c8057f2b173db726a79",
      "text": "Grilling",
      "hash": "78318482b2ed0e5dd1aa46addef2c3b1c379b1f3b213eac3337b8fe2b40ab6aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "783b096d248ec825581510051d001b2366a298fc10508e14f67cd8102e3240f9",
      "text": "A technique for developing a design concept: the agent interviews the user Socratically, one decision at a time.",
      "hash": "ccd13e44dc8aeef98ba2674fd7b44678089e580e85e3f901351796315240a34c"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7f5e7fddd0004ff766370590b1c8d527f6fb210fc63f03bc19e532a8eac9b48",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "2f6b85414b6ba955c34dee93e1c6fb05e91844f1b177252c9fbbce27fffbf7ca",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "cd31022fe27ab80c1cc58268ad24425992660f69e5b80efbac04ca213276e2fa",
      "text": "A technique for developing a",
      "hash": "1adedb24ec0d07dc15db502831d05e4ed7fc6b49d81e5825439d59a983248173"
    },
    {
      "id": "57fa61de5967f8f15f57c75784922c801bf9aefbcb1e0fa17f9bf3c2022b3044",
      "text": "design concept",
      "hash": "6ae84ca998a976763f79c817e8b8d469a75a0c9c0f08c154e1f767a358dda43e"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3a0aee498bb7fc5de5350ac095c720d2c36fa6d1b81d30372cb12c3fc6e4113",
      "text": "with an",
      "hash": "6ecddf32f1167dfef0838686471bfe0b81f98a3289c8016d338618fe2bad8f41"
    },
    {
      "id": "20161f7d21a271240c2b2c125a72cbe3fa51909442c3a3f5461bcdf16f780229",
      "text": ": the agent interviews the user Socratically, one decision at a time, proposing a recommended answer for each. Slows the rush to a finished plan — no",
      "hash": "3e6f6c884476e5d75ab8caf532a29c395364d8147acee105f9036e6ce1a8e9b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "7364f62707c5456ab18a56900e3a800b626598924a1b82e5d67e79c82f4f6aef",
      "text": "handoff artifact",
      "hash": "741619a26b388b5e1035994e6e7ce6c59c885ebd231ad21f8d9ff02438a0cbc9"
    },
    {
      "id": "58becfae25175c7680d9e2ba3af98a54007309746625ca261b0c3a689466361a",
      "text": "is written until the concept stabilises.",
      "hash": "15ada79484bd42e11807050dc430aed9ae70d95f1ecdf29ad99b030e61d6f335"
    },
    {
      "id": "5e49c1479dca6c5e3dff1673cb788593709da99081ded8c63142c0121cd42422",
      "text": "The technique exists because agents fill gaps silently. Asked to write a",
      "hash": "dfc943e27baaa6060971d2ffcf7636d9167d17dce9d36e6b237d36deb9d67a17"
    },
    {
      "id": "d06b40956843930ad7443432c105fdda2338dda229354d48179aba67a7b49f73",
      "text": "from a two-line prompt, the agent doesn't stop at the decisions you haven't made — it picks defaults and writes them in. The result looks complete, and the guesses are indistinguishable from the choices, so you discover them late: at review, or when the built feature handles an edge case in a way you never chose. Grilling inverts this — instead of guessing, the agent has to ask.",
      "hash": "4084b9f6455cd541055db558554758af234074edcfd4b3c43784578095cbcca8"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e0157c9dd043250c0219b1d4c59cbf35addb7305c0e62cfe7cdb829f19bebd0",
      "text": "It's a",
      "hash": "4563b3669cc90cb903accac1cb2982afa8d5303ac30482e8b4598b8415c56b1f"
    },
    {
      "id": "23944a2becb5f1e1981d3e80aafbef9e5205bb5245edd59cce6c5e5c4b2f078e",
      "text": "technique: your answers are the input. When a question can't be answered in conversation — you'd have to see the thing — switch to",
      "hash": "930158311d02a4c397ce30738552d3641dbfc4e529b25b8b5525ebe93990e00c"
    },
    {
      "id": "0220299db5794bf31eb56ef1283f756dde6c1ce31305d845f3647721972956f9",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "208e294479d071247860c5b742a096991e33aa05ff63069e079a07ec970f9abf",
      "text": "\"It went straight to writing the spec and got the cancellation logic wrong.\"",
      "hash": "b3ac43eb626710615caef780dd8ad5243910b12920405d6469ea582e2cb5f549"
    },
    {
      "id": "fb88aad8c3527531cd7ac4756d00ff2c20c6e14d7bd703bbe9af78c7d9e90656",
      "text": "\"Grill it first — make it ask you about partial cancels, refunds, and timing before it commits anything to the doc. Cheaper to resolve in conversation than in code.\"",
      "hash": "22a02aa532ac6a4d3f70a293c89f4aa6b1be8b55765d1ddbb7b6233cf3400da7"
    },
    {
      "id": "96af6d005f7548ad7bf495937fa7445f84bd225d6575dd697f0154f282e612fd",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "33cdd418467f8286e4d000b88ffe686f0153481d166cf18f83ee01d310ea424a",
      "text": "Design concept",
